      "comment" : "A text field where a user can input a model key. The placeholder text shows the user's display name followed by the credential kind name in lowercase. The text field is styled to look like a plain text field with a \"Done\" button for submission. An overlay is shown when the text field is empty, displaying the model key with asterisks to protect its contents. A button labeled \"Save\" appears below",
