        }
      }
    },
    "Adds this service to a conversation, giving Ox its actions and your logged-in data." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "将此服务添加到对话，让 Ox 可以使用其操作和你的登录数据。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agent improvements: Bounded generation through configured models, on-demand API/schema discovery, and temporary files for reading large execution outputs." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体改进：通过已配置的模型执行有明确限制的生成任务，按需发现 API 和数据结构，并使用临时文件读取较大的执行输出。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Agents can access logged-in data, send messages, delete data, and spend money without asking. Mistakes may cause permanent data loss or unwanted charges. This approves pending requests and future use of capabilities in all conversations and profiles until turned off. System permissions and private-data consent still apply." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "智能体无需询问即可访问已登录账号的数据、发送消息、删除数据和花钱。操作失误可能导致数据永久丢失或意外扣费。启用后会批准所有对话和档案中正在等待批准的请求，并允许之后使用所有能力，直到你关闭此设置。系统权限和私密数据授权仍需确认。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
