            "value" : "提供服务目录的 Ox API 端点。将其指向任何运行 Ox 服务器协议的主机。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The remote repository is the source of truth. Sync replaces these files, including local edits. Copy the folder elsewhere to keep your changes." : {
